<title>USA: Jordan seeks 100,000T optional-origin wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 100,000T optional-origin wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan is scheduled to tender July 23 for 100,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter or hard red spring wheat or equivalent wheat from other countries, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The tender announcement specified half of the tonnage for last-half August shipment and the balance for last-half September shipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
